#HELPS
1 GNISIS~
Gnisis is the largest settlement in northwest Vvardenfell, built on a hillside
under an egg mine where Redoran homes gather around a busy riverside crossing.
A Tribunal Temple, tradehouse and tiny Imperial fort serve locals and visitors
as ash winds sweep the plain beyond its crowded streets.~
